49c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/c0bfb23b-7413-49c5-ba67-3d9d396d5cd7.wav\"}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(10,'2026-10-16 05:34:01.000000','2026-10-16 05:34:01.000000','A2','LISTENING_DIALOGUE','a58d99d1-f378-4ed1-9053-fab64f4034cb',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"listeningPassage\":\"Speaker A: Hi Emma, did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\nSpeaker B: Hi Tom, yes I loved it! The band was amazing.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I was thinking about our weekend. Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. Which movie are you interested in?\\nSpeaker A: I heard the comedy \\\"Sunny Days\\\" is funny. It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker B: I can be there at 2:45 pm. We could buy tickets online now.\\nSpeaker A: Good idea. I’ll book two seats for us.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks. After the film, maybe we can have coffee at the café near the park.\\nSpeaker A: Perfect. They open at 5 pm, so we’ll have time.\\nSpeaker B: Do you think we should invite Lily?\\nSpeaker A: Sure, she said she wanted to join. I’ll send her a message tonight.\\nSpeaker B: Great, see you Saturday then!\\nSpeaker A: See you!\",\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What event did Speaker A ask about at the beginning?\",\"options\":[\"A) A football match\",\"B) A concert\",\"C) A theater play\",\"D) A workshop\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) A concert\",\"explanation\":\"Trong câu mở đầu Speaker A nói: \\\"did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\\" nên đáp án đúng là \\\"A concert\\\". Các lựa chọn khác không xuất hiện trong đoạn hội thoại, vì vậy chúng là các đáp án gây nhầm lẫn.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi Emma, did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\nSpeaker B: Hi Tom, yes I loved it! The band was amazing.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I was thinking about our weekend. Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. Which movie are you interested in?\\nSpeaker A: I heard the comedy \\\"Sunny Days\\\" is funny. It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker B: I can be there at 2:45 pm. We could buy tickets online now.\\nSpeaker A: Good idea. I’ll book two seats for us.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks. After the film, maybe we can have coffee at the café near the park.\\nSpeaker A: Perfect. They open at 5 pm, so we’ll have time.\\nSpeaker B: Do you think we should invite Lily?\\nSpeaker A: Sure, she said she wanted to join. I’ll send her a message tonight.\\nSpeaker B: Great, see you Saturday then!\\nSpeaker A: See you!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Which day do they plan to go to the cinema?\",\"options\":[\"A) Friday\",\"B) Saturday\",\"C) Sunday\",\"D) Monday\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Saturday\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A hỏi: \\\"Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\\" và Speaker B trả lời đồng ý, vì vậy ngày họ định đi là Saturday (thứ Bảy).\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi Emma, did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\nSpeaker B: Hi Tom, yes I loved it! The band was amazing.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I was thinking about our weekend. Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. Which movie are you interested in?\\nSpeaker A: I heard the comedy \\\"Sunny Days\\\" is funny. It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker B: I can be there at 2:45 pm. We could buy tickets online now.\\nSpeaker A: Good idea. I’ll book two seats for us.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks. After the film, maybe we can have coffee at the café near the park.\\nSpeaker A: Perfect. They open at 5 pm, so we’ll have time.\\nSpeaker B: Do you think we should invite Lily?\\nSpeaker A: Sure, she said she wanted to join. I’ll send her a message tonight.\\nSpeaker B: Great, see you Saturday then!\\nSpeaker A: See you!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What time does the movie start?\",\"options\":[\"A) 2 pm\",\"B) 3 pm\",\"C) 4 pm\",\"D) 5 pm\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) 3 pm\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói: \\\"It starts at 3 pm.\\\" Đây là thời gian bắt đầu của bộ phim, các lựa chọn khác không xuất hiện trong đoạn hội thoại.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi Emma, did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\nSpeaker B: Hi Tom, yes I loved it! The band was amazing.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I was thinking about our weekend. Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. Which movie are you interested in?\\nSpeaker A: I heard the comedy \\\"Sunny Days\\\" is funny. It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker B: I can be there at 2:45 pm. We could buy tickets online now.\\nSpeaker A: Good idea. I’ll book two seats for us.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks. After the film, maybe we can have coffee at the café near the park.\\nSpeaker A: Perfect. They open at 5 pm, so we’ll have time.\\nSpeaker B: Do you think we should invite Lily?\\nSpeaker A: Sure, she said she wanted to join. I’ll send her a message tonight.\\nSpeaker B: Great, see you Saturday then!\\nSpeaker A: See you!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"How many tickets will Speaker A book?\",\"options\":[\"A) One\",\"B) Two\",\"C) Three\",\"D) Four\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Two\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói: \\\"I’ll book two seats for us.\\\" Vì vậy số vé là hai. Các đáp án khác không đúng.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi Emma, did you enjoy the concert last Friday?\\nSpeaker B: Hi Tom, yes I loved it! The band was amazing.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I was thinking about our weekend. Do you want to go to the new cinema on Saturday?\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. Which movie are you interested in?\\nSpeaker A: I heard the comedy \\\"Sunny Days\\\" is funny. It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker B: I can be there at 2:45 pm. We could buy tickets online now.\\nSpeaker A: Good idea. I’ll book two seats for us.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks. After the film, maybe we can have coffee at the café near the park.\\nSpeaker A: Perfect. They open at 5 pm, so we’ll have time.\\nSpeaker B: Do you think we should invite Lily?\\nSpeaker A: Sure, she said she wanted to join. I’ll send her a message tonight.\\nSpeaker B: Great, see you Saturday then!\\nSpeaker A: See you!\"}]}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(15,'2026-10-16 06:14:02.000000','2026-10-16 06:14:02.000000','B1','LISTENING_DIALOGUE','b685303b-b2f4-4448-b2b5-c16cf61bf935',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"listeningPassage\":\"Speaker A: Hey, Maya, have you decided what to do this weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Not yet. I was thinking about going to the new sci‑fi film on Saturday, but I\'m not sure about the timing.\\nSpeaker A: The movie starts at 7 pm, and the theatre is only a ten‑minute walk from my flat. If we leave at 6:30, we’ll have enough time to grab a coffee first.\\nSpeaker B: That sounds good. However, my sister is visiting on Saturday afternoon, so I might have to finish my plans by 5 pm.\\nSpeaker A: In that case, we could meet at the café near the station at 5:45. Then we’ll have a quick snack and head straight to the cinema.\\nSpeaker B: I like that idea. By the way, did you hear that the cinema is offering a \\\"buy one, get one free\\\" ticket deal on Tuesdays, but not on weekends?\\nSpeaker A: Yes, I read it online yesterday. Since it’s a weekend, we’ll have to pay for both tickets, but I can book them online now to avoid the queue.\\nSpeaker B: Great. If we book now, we’ll also get a seat reservation, which is useful because the film is expected to be popular.\\nSpeaker A: Exactly. Also, the theatre will run a short preview of a documentary about space exploration before the main feature. It should start at 6:55.\\nSpeaker B: That’s interesting. I’m curious about the documentary, so I’ll stay for it. After the movie, maybe we could walk to the park and talk about it.\\nSpeaker A: Good plan. The park is open until 9 pm, and the weather forecast says it will be clear. So we’ll have enough time to relax before heading home.\\nSpeaker B: Perfect. I’ll send you the booking confirmation tonight and we can finalize the details tomorrow.\",\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What time does the new sci‑fi film start?\",\"options\":[\"A) 6 pm\",\"B) 7 pm\",\"C) 8 pm\",\"D) 5 pm\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) 7 pm\",\"explanation\":\"Trong đoạn hội thoại, Speaker A nói \\\"The movie starts at 7 pm\\\". Các lựa chọn khác không xuất hiện, vì vậy đáp án đúng là B) 7 pm.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"How far is the cinema from Speaker A’s flat?\",\"options\":[\"A) Five‑minute walk\",\"B) Ten‑minute walk\",\"C) Fifteen‑minute bus ride\",\"D) Across the street\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Ten‑minute walk\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói \\\"the theatre is only a ten‑minute walk from my flat\\\". Do đó, đáp án B là chính xác.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Why does Speaker B need to finish plans by 5 pm?\",\"options\":[\"A) He has a work shift\",\"B) His sister is visiting\",\"C) He has a doctor\'s appointment\",\"D) He needs to study\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) His sister is visiting\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B giải thích \\\"my sister is visiting on Saturday afternoon, so I might have to finish my plans by 5 pm\\\". Vì vậy đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"At what time do they propose to meet at the café?\",\"options\":[\"A) 5:45\",\"B) 6:00\",\"C) 5:30\",\"D) 6:15\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"A) 5:45\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A đề xuất \\\"we could meet at the café near the station at 5:45\\\". Đáp án A phản ánh đúng thông tin.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What special ticket offer is available on Tuesdays?\",\"options\":[\"A) 20% discount\",\"B) Buy one, get one free\",\"C) Free popcorn\",\"D) Early entry\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Buy one, get one free\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B nói \\\"the cinema is offering a \'buy one, get one free\' ticket deal on Tuesdays\\\". Vì vậy đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Why do they decide to book tickets online now?\",\"options\":[\"A) To get a discount\",\"B) To avoid the queue\",\"C) To choose a different movie\",\"D) To get free drinks\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) To avoid the queue\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A giải thích \\\"I can book them online now to avoid the queue\\\". Do đó đáp án B là chính xác.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What extra benefit does online booking provide?\",\"options\":[\"A) Free snacks\",\"B) Seat reservation\",\"C) Free poster\",\"D) Priority parking\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Seat reservation\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B nói \\\"we’ll also get a seat reservation\\\" khi đặt vé online. Vì vậy đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What will be shown before the main feature?\",\"options\":[\"A) A short comedy\",\"B) A documentary about space exploration\",\"C) A music video\",\"D) A trailer compilation\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) A documentary about space exploration\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A thông báo \\\"the theatre will run a short preview of a documentary about space exploration before the main feature\\\". Đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"When does the documentary preview start?\",\"options\":[\"A) 6:55\",\"B) 7:10\",\"C) 6:30\",\"D) 7:00\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"A) 6:55\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói \\\"It should start at 6:55\\\". Vì vậy đáp án A là chính xác.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What do the friends plan to do after the movie?\",\"options\":[\"A) Go shopping\",\"B) Walk to the park\",\"C) Return home immediately\",\"D) Visit a museum\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Walk to the park\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B đề xuất \\\"maybe we could walk to the park and talk about it\\\" sau phim. Do đó đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Until what time is the park open?\",\"options\":[\"A) 10 pm\",\"B) 8 pm\",\"C) 9 pm\",\"D) 7 pm\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"C) 9 pm\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói \\\"The park is open until 9 pm\\\". Vì vậy đáp án C là chính xác.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"According to the forecast, what will the weather be like?\",\"options\":[\"A) Rainy\",\"B) Snowy\",\"C) Clear\",\"D) Windy\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"C) Clear\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói \\\"the weather forecast says it will be clear\\\". Đáp án C là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Who will send the booking confirmation tonight?\",\"options\":[\"A) Speaker A\",\"B) Speaker B\",\"C) Both\",\"D) Neither\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Speaker B\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B kết thúc bằng \\\"I’ll send you the booking confirmation tonight\\\". Vì vậy đáp án B là đúng.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What is the main reason Speaker A suggests leaving at 6:30?\",\"options\":[\"A) To catch the early show\",\"B) To have time for coffee\",\"C) To avoid traffic\",\"D) To meet a friend\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) To have time for coffee\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A giải thích \\\"If we leave at 6:30, we’ll have enough time to grab a coffee first\\\". Vì vậy đáp án B là chính xác.\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Which day does the \\\"buy one, get one free\\\" ticket deal NOT apply?\",\"options\":[\"A) Tuesday\",\"B) Wednesday\",\"C) Thursday\",\"D) Friday\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Wednesday\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B nói rằng ưu đãi chỉ có vào \\\"Tuesdays, but not on weekends\\\". Do đó, ngày không áp dụng trong các lựa chọn là Wednesday (cũng không phải là Tuesday). Vì vậy đáp án B là đúng.\"}]}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(5,'2026-10-15 19:01:41.000000','2026-10-15 19:01:41.000000','A1','LISTENING_DIALOGUE','cc720989-f8b0-4563-8472-45eccd9d7ec3',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"listeningPassage\":\"Friend A: Hi, Lisa! Do you have any plans for this weekend?\\nFriend B: Hi, Tom! I want to go to the cinema. Do you want to come with me?\\nFriend A: Yes, that sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nFriend B: I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\". It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.\\nFriend A: Great! How much is the ticket?\\nFriend B: The ticket is five euros. We can buy two tickets online.\\nFriend A: Okay, I will pay you the money on Friday.\\nFriend A: Do you want popcorn?\\nFriend B: Yes, one small popcorn each, please.\\nFriend B: Perfect. Shall we meet at the mall at 3:30?\\nFriend A: Yes, see you at the mall. Bye!\\nFriend B: Bye!\",\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What does Friend B want to do this weekend?\",\"options\":[\"A) Go shopping\",\"B) Go to the cinema\",\"C) Visit a museum\",\"D) Stay at home\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Go to the cinema\",\"explanation\":\"Trong đoạn hội thoại, Friend B nói: “I want to go to the cinema.” Đây là câu duy nhất mô tả kế hoạch của anh ấy cho cuối tuần, vì vậy đáp án B là đúng. Các lựa chọn A, C, D không xuất hiện trong đoạn.\",\"transcript\":\"Friend A: Hi, Lisa! Do you have any plans for this weekend?\\nFriend B: Hi, Tom! I want to go to the cinema. Do you want to come with me?\\nFriend A: Yes, that sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nFriend B: I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\". It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.\\nFriend A: Great! How much is the ticket?\\nFriend B: The ticket is five euros. We can buy two tickets online.\\nFriend A: Okay, I will pay you the money on Friday.\\nFriend A: Do you want popcorn?\\nFriend B: Yes, one small popcorn each, please.\\nFriend B: Perfect. Shall we meet at the mall at 3:30?\\nFriend A: Yes, see you at the mall. Bye!\\nFriend B: Bye!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What is the name of the film they plan to watch?\",\"options\":[\"A) Sunny Day\",\"B) Happy Night\",\"C) Blue Sky\",\"D) Red Moon\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"A) Sunny Day\",\"explanation\":\"Friend B nói: “I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\".” Vì vậy tên phim là Sunny Day. Các đáp án khác không xuất hiện trong đoạn.\",\"transcript\":\"Friend A: Hi, Lisa! Do you have any plans for this weekend?\\nFriend B: Hi, Tom! I want to go to the cinema. Do you want to come with me?\\nFriend A: Yes, that sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nFriend B: I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\". It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.\\nFriend A: Great! How much is the ticket?\\nFriend B: The ticket is five euros. We can buy two tickets online.\\nFriend A: Okay, I will pay you the money on Friday.\\nFriend A: Do you want popcorn?\\nFriend B: Yes, one small popcorn each, please.\\nFriend B: Perfect. Shall we meet at the mall at 3:30?\\nFriend A: Yes, see you at the mall. Bye!\\nFriend B: Bye!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"At what time does the film start on Saturday?\",\"options\":[\"A) 3:00 pm\",\"B) 4:00 pm\",\"C) 5:00 pm\",\"D) 6:00 pm\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) 4:00 pm\",\"explanation\":\"Trong câu Friend B: “It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.” Vì vậy thời gian bắt đầu là 4:00 pm. Các lựa chọn khác không đúng.\",\"transcript\":\"Friend A: Hi, Lisa! Do you have any plans for this weekend?\\nFriend B: Hi, Tom! I want to go to the cinema. Do you want to come with me?\\nFriend A: Yes, that sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nFriend B: I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\". It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.\\nFriend A: Great! How much is the ticket?\\nFriend B: The ticket is five euros. We can buy two tickets online.\\nFriend A: Okay, I will pay you the money on Friday.\\nFriend A: Do you want popcorn?\\nFriend B: Yes, one small popcorn each, please.\\nFriend B: Perfect. Shall we meet at the mall at 3:30?\\nFriend A: Yes, see you at the mall. Bye!\\nFriend B: Bye!\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"How much does one ticket cost?\",\"options\":[\"A) three euros\",\"B) four euros\",\"C) five euros\",\"D) six euros\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"C) five euros\",\"explanation\":\"Friend B trả lời: “The ticket is five euros.” Đây là giá của mỗi vé. Các đáp án A, B, D không khớp với thông tin trong đoạn.\",\"transcript\":\"Friend A: Hi, Lisa! Do you have any plans for this weekend?\\nFriend B: Hi, Tom! I want to go to the cinema. Do you want to come with me?\\nFriend A: Yes, that sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nFriend B: I would like to see the new comedy, \\\"Sunny Day\\\". It starts at 4 pm on Saturday.\\nFriend A: Great! How much is the ticket?\\nFriend B: The ticket is five euros. We can buy two tickets online.\\nFriend A: Okay, I will pay you the money on Friday.\\nFriend A: Do you want popcorn?\\nFriend B: Yes, one small popcorn each, please.\\nFriend B: Perfect. Shall we meet at the mall at 3:30?\\nFriend A: Yes, see you at the mall. Bye!\\nFriend B: Bye!\"}]}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(5,'2026-10-15 19:03:07.000000','2026-10-15 19:03:07.000000','A1','SPEAKING_QA','d686263f-d7f7-4046-9731-a0f2dd42bf72',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"AUDIO_RESPONSE\",\"question\":\"Can you tell me your name and how old you are?\",\"prompt\":\"Can you tell me your name and how old you are?\",\"explanation\":\"Hướng dẫn: Giới thiệu tên (My name is …) + tuổi (I am … years old). Từ vựng: name, age, years old, I’m. Câu mẫu: \\\"My name is Anna. I am twenty‑five years old.\\\" Hoặc \\\"I’m twenty‑five.\\\"\",\"correctAnswer\":\"Tên của mình, tuổi (số tuổi + \\\"years old\\\"), dùng câu \\\"My name is …\\\" và \\\"I am … years old\\\".\"},{\"questionType\":\"AUDIO_RESPONSE\",\"question\":\"Where are you from? Please name your hometown and one thing you like about it.\",\"prompt\":\"Where are you from? Please name your hometown and one thing you like about it.\",\"explanation\":\"Từ vựng: hometown, city, village, from, like, beautiful, quiet, big, small, famous. Câu mẫu: \\\"I am from Hanoi. I like the beautiful lakes there.\\\" Hoặc \\\"My hometown is a small town called … and I love the friendly people.\\\"\",\"correctAnswer\":\"Tên địa phương (city/town/village), câu \\\"I am from …\\\" hoặc \\\"My hometown is …\\\", và một lý do thích (beautiful, quiet, friendly, etc.).\"},{\"questionType\":\"AUDIO_RESPONSE\",\"question\":\"What do you usually do in the morning?\",\"prompt\":\"What do you usually do in the morning?\",\"explanation\":\"Từ vựng: wake up, get up, brush my teeth, have breakfast, go to school/work, take the bus, study. Câu mẫu: \\\"I wake up at 7 a.m., brush my teeth, and have breakfast. Then I go to school by bus.\\\"\",\"correctAnswer\":\"Hoạt động buổi sáng (wake up, brush teeth, breakfast, go to school/work, transport), thứ tự thời gian, dùng từ \\\"usually\\\".\"},{\"questionType\":\"AUDIO_RESPONSE\",\"question\":\"Describe one activity you do every day after school or work.\",\"prompt\":\"Describe one activity you do every day after school or work.\",\"explanation\":\"Từ vựng: after school, after work, I usually…, I often…, I like to…, exercise, read a book, watch TV, do homework, meet friends. Câu mẫu: \\\"After school I usually do my homework and then watch TV for 30 minutes.\\\"\",\"correctAnswer\":\"Hoạt động hằng ngày sau giờ học/đi làm (homework, TV, exercise, reading, etc.), dùng \\\"usually\\\" hoặc \\\"every day\\\".\"},{\"questionType\":\"AUDIO_RESPONSE\",\"question\":\"What time do you go to bed and how do you feel before sleeping?\",\"prompt\":\"What time do you go to bed and how do you feel before sleeping?\",\"explanation\":\"Từ vựng: go to bed, at … o’clock, feel, tired, sleepy, relaxed, happy. Câu mẫu: \\\"I go to bed at 10 p.m. I feel sleepy and relaxed.\\\"\",\"correctAnswer\":\"Giờ đi ngủ (at …), cảm xúc trước khi ngủ (tired, sleepy, relaxed, happy).\"}]}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(5,'2026-10-16 05:31:18.000000','2026-10-16 05:31:18.000000','A1','LISTENING_DIALOGUE','dc9cbaa2-279f-4c06-854b-41471b972b30',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"listeningPassage\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What day are the friends planning to go to the cinema?\",\"options\":[\"A) Friday\",\"B) Saturday\",\"C) Sunday\",\"D) Monday\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Saturday\",\"explanation\":\"Trong đoạn hội thoại Speaker B nói “I am free on Saturday” và Speaker B cuối cùng nói “See you Saturday”. Vì vậy ngày họ định đi là Saturday. Các lựa chọn khác không xuất hiện trong đoạn.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"Which movie do they want to watch?\",\"options\":[\"A) \\\"Funny Days\\\"\",\"B) \\\"Happy Hours\\\"\",\"C) \\\"Adventure Land\\\"\",\"D) \\\"Mystery Night\\\"\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"A) \\\"Funny Days\\\"\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker B nói “I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\"”. Đây là tên phim duy nhất được nhắc tới, vì vậy đáp án đúng là A. Các tiêu đề còn lại không có trong đoạn.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"How many tickets does Speaker A intend to buy?\",\"options\":[\"A) One\",\"B) Two\",\"C) Three\",\"D) Four\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Two\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói “I can buy two tickets online now”. Vì vậy số lượng vé là hai. Các lựa chọn khác không khớp với thông tin này.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"What extra food does Speaker B ask for?\",\"options\":[\"A) Large popcorn\",\"B) Small popcorn\",\"C) Hot dog\",\"D) Ice cream\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) Small popcorn\",\"explanation\":\"Khi Speaker A hỏi “Do you want popcorn?” Speaker B trả lời “Yes, a small popcorn, please”. Vì vậy đáp án đúng là “Small popcorn”. Các lựa chọn khác không được đề cập.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"prompt\":\"At what time will Speaker A pick up the tickets?\",\"options\":[\"A) 2:00\",\"B) 2:30\",\"C) 3:00\",\"D) 3:30\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"B) 2:30\",\"explanation\":\"Speaker A nói “I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30”. Đây là thời gian duy nhất được nêu, vì vậy đáp án là 2:30. Các thời gian khác không xuất hiện.\",\"transcript\":\"Speaker A: Hi, Sara! Do you have any plans for the weekend?\\nSpeaker B: Hi, Tom! I am free on Saturday. Maybe we can go to the cinema.\\nSpeaker A: That sounds good. Which film do you want to see?\\nSpeaker B: I would like to watch the new comedy, \\\"Funny Days\\\". It starts at 3 pm.\\nSpeaker A: Great! I can buy two tickets online now.\\nSpeaker B: OK, please book the seats near the screen.\\nSpeaker A: I will pay with my card. Do you want popcorn?\\nSpeaker B: Yes, a small popcorn, please.\\nSpeaker A: All right, I will pick up the tickets at the box office at 2:30.\\nSpeaker B: Thanks, Tom. See you Saturday at the cinema!\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"}],\"audioUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://pub-35c3a549c2974161a9d0e87abfbb7473.r2.dev/audio/027502cf-d715-4988-bf89-245cac01382f.wav\"}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(5,'2026-10-16 11:01:39.000000','2026-10-16 11:01:39.000000','A1','VOCAB_MATCHING','de7b56ca-0cde-481c-82f2-0de5cca6832d',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\"questions\":[{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"targetWord\":\"mother\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈmʌðər/\",\"prompt\":\"Nối từ với nghĩa phù hợp: Định nghĩa chính xác nhất của từ \'mother\' là gì?\",\"options\":[\"a female parent\",\"a male sibling\",\"a place where you sleep\",\"a type of food\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"a female parent\",\"explanation\":\"Phiên âm IPA: /ˈmʌðər/ | \'mother\' (noun): người mẹ, là phụ huynh nữ. Dùng để nói về người phụ trách nuôi dạy con cái. Ví dụ: My mother cooks dinner every night.\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=mother&type=2\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=mother&type=2\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"targetWord\":\"brother\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈbrʌðər/\",\"prompt\":\"Nối từ với nghĩa phù hợp: Định nghĩa chính xác nhất của từ \'brother\' là gì?\",\"options\":[\"a male sibling\",\"a piece of furniture\",\"the first meal of the day\",\"a room for washing clothes\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"a male sibling\",\"explanation\":\"Phiên âm IPA: /ˈbrʌðər/ | \'brother\' (noun): anh trai hoặc em trai, người cùng cha mẹ. Ví dụ: Tom is my brother.\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=brother&type=2\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=brother&type=2\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"targetWord\":\"kitchen\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈkɪtʃən/\",\"prompt\":\"Nối từ với nghĩa phù hợp: Định nghĩa chính xác nhất của từ \'kitchen\' là gì?\",\"options\":[\"a room where food is prepared\",\"a place to sleep\",\"a type of clothing\",\"a daily exercise\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"a room where food is prepared\",\"explanation\":\"Phiên âm IPA: /ˈkɪtʃən/ | \'kitchen\' (noun): nhà bếp, nơi nấu ăn và chuẩn bị thực phẩm. Ví dụ: The kitchen is clean today.\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=kitchen&type=2\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=kitchen&type=2\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"targetWord\":\"breakfast\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈbrɛkfəst/\",\"prompt\":\"Nối từ với nghĩa phù hợp: Định nghĩa chính xác nhất của từ \'breakfast\' là gì?\",\"options\":[\"the first meal of the day\",\"a piece of furniture\",\"a family member\",\"a room for washing dishes\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"the first meal of the day\",\"explanation\":\"Phiên âm IPA: /ˈbrɛkfəst/ | \'breakfast\' (noun): bữa sáng, bữa ăn đầu tiên sau khi ngủ. Ví dụ: I eat cereal for breakfast.\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=breakfast&type=2\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=breakfast&type=2\"},{\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\",\"targetWord\":\"sofa\",\"ipa\":\"/ˈsoʊfə/\",\"prompt\":\"Nối từ với nghĩa phù hợp: Định nghĩa chính xác nhất của từ \'sofa\' là gì?\",\"options\":[\"a comfortable seat for several people\",\"a kitchen utensil\",\"a type of shoe\",\"a daily routine\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"a comfortable seat for several people\",\"explanation\":\"Phiên âm IPA: /ˈsoʊfə/ | \'sofa\' (noun): ghế dài, thường đặt trong phòng khách để ngồi nghỉ ngơi. Ví dụ: We sit on the sofa to watch TV.\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=sofa&type=2\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://dict.youdao.com/dictvoice?audio=sofa&type=2\"}]}','READY_FOR_REVIEW'),(5,'2026-10-16 11:01:22.000000','2026-10-16 11:01:22.000000','A1','GRAMMAR_MULTIPLE_CHOICE','e36cb591-787b-4d4d-95fa-9670053cdf20',NULL,'831551b0-25ef-46f8-a834-eb1945a5aad0','{\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"______ she drinks coffee in the morning?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Always\", \"Usually\", \"Never\", \"Often\"],\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"Usually\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Trong câu hỏi, trạng từ tần suất (always, usually, never, often) được đặt sau chủ ngữ và trước động từ. \\\"Usually\\\" là đáp án đúng vì câu hỏi muốn hỏi về thói quen thường xuyên. Các đáp án khác không phù hợp với ngữ cảnh hoặc không phản ánh thói quen trung bình.\",\n      \"questionType\": \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"I ______ eat meat.\",\n      \"options\": [\"always\", \"usually\", \"never\", \"often\"],\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"never\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Trong câu phủ định, trạng từ \\\"never\\\" (không bao giờ) đứng trước động từ. Câu \\\"I never eat meat\\\" diễn tả thói quen không ăn thịt. Các lựa chọn khác (always, usually, often) không mang nghĩa phủ định.\",\n      \"questionType\": \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"My brother always ______ (play) football every weekend.\",\n      \"options\": [\"play\", \"plays\", \"playing\", \"played\"],\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"plays\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Chủ ngữ \\\"my brother\\\" là ngôi thứ ba số ít, vì vậy động từ ở thì hiện tại đơn phải thêm -s: \\\"plays\\\". Trạng từ \\\"always\\\" đặt trước động từ để nhấn mạnh thói quen. Các đáp án khác sai về hình thức hoặc thời gian.\",\n      \"questionType\": \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"______ you always read before sleep?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Do\", \"Does\", \"Are\", \"Is\"],\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"Do\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Với chủ ngữ \\\"you\\\" trong câu hỏi hiện tại đơn, trợ động từ phải là \\\"do\\\". Trạng từ \\\"always\\\" đặt sau chủ ngữ: \\\"Do you always read...\\\". \\\"Does\\\" chỉ dùng cho ngôi thứ ba số ít, còn \\\"are\\\" và \\\"is\\\" không phù hợp cho câu hỏi này.\",\n      \"questionType\": \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"She never ______ (watch) horror movies.\",\n      \"options\": [\"watch\", \"watches\", \"watched\", \"watching\"],\n      \"correctAnswer\": \"watches\",\n      \"explanation\": \"Chủ ngữ \\\"she\\\" là ngôi thứ ba số ít, vì vậy động từ ở thì hiện tại đơn phải có -s: \\\"watches\\\". Trạng từ \\\"never\\\" (không bao giờ) đứng trước động từ để tạo phủ định. Các đáp án khác không tuân theo quy tắc chia động từ hoặc sai thời gian.\",\n      \"questionType\": \"MULTIPLE_CHOICE\"\n    }\n  ]\n}','READY_FOR_REVIEW');
